Step 9 of the build-up. Identical to linux-thread-vs-vcpu-thread-8.svg (see
that prompt), with nothing moved, plus a VM exit that goes to the VMM:

- Kernel (unlabelled, exit to user space) -> "emulate" (user) ->
  "handle + vmx" (kernel) -> guest code continues to the right edge.
- A dashed red leader line from the "emulate" bar down to the caption
  "VM exit to the VMM (e.g. device access)".
